{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Right, Mal. I'm still on the fence about him, but perhaps after the war is done, we can sit by some tea and talk. Regardless, if you need our help we'll do what we can, and towards this city's restoration, I'll work alongside him and anyone willing to lend a hand as well.\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T18:49:24.471000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879074798871924746","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
